    "title_en": "AOC Ajaccio: Esquistos y Granitos para la Sciacaccarello: Mechanism and Enological Significance",
    "summary_es": "La AOC Ajaccio destaca por suelos graníticos que confieren acidez elevada y notas minerales a la Sciacaccarello, con aromas típicos de maquia corsa.",
    "summary_en": "AOC Ajaccio stands out for granitic soils that confer high acidity and mineral notes to Sciacarello, with typical Corsican maquia aromas.",
    "content_es": "Los suelos graníticos y esquistos de la AOC Ajaccio poseen baja retención hídrica, forzando a la vid a desarrollar raíces profundas. Bioquímicamente, esto concentra antocianinas y taninos en bayas pequeñas, resultando en vinos tintos con color intenso y acidez vibrante. Sensorialmente, el terroir mineraliza el perfil, aportando notas de almendra tostada y especias silvestres derivadas de la maquia corsa.",
    "content_en": "The granitic and schist soils of AOC Ajaccio have low water retention, forcing the vine to develop deep roots. Biochemically, this concentrates anthocyanins and tannins in small berries, resulting in red wines with intense color and vibrant acidity. Sensorially, the mineral terroir profiles the wine, contributing notes of toasted almond and wild spices derived from Corsican maquia.",
